<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Novel Denim started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Novel Denim started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Monday it had started coverage of Novel Denim Holdings Ltd with a rating of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Hong Kong-based jeans maker closed Friday at 22-4/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
